    - Term: SUBSCRIPTION/Pack_Description_MonthlySupply
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Lots of Gems every day<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>+1 Buff reroll per battle<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>3x battle speed<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Max AFK reward time: 24h<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Много самоцветов каждый день<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>+1 переброс усиления за бой<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Скорость битвы x3<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Макс. время наград офлайн: 24 ч.<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Täglich zahlreiche Edelsteine<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Pro Kampf +1 Buff neu auswürfeln<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>3x Kampfgeschwindigkeit<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Max. Offline-Belohnungszeit: 24 Std.<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>De nombreuses gemmes tous les jours<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>+1 relance de buffs par combat<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Vitesse de combat x3<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Temps de récompense d'AFK max : 24 h<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Un montón de gemas a diario<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>+1 cambio de mejora por batalla<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Velocidad de batalla x3<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Tiempo máximo de recompensa en ausencia: 24 h<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Parecchie gemme al giorno<br>\n <sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>+1 cambio di potenziamenti per battaglia<br>\n <sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Velocità battaglia x3<br>\n <sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Tempo max offline per ricompense: 24 h<br>\n"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Muitas Joias todo dia<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>+1 sorteio de reforço por batalha<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Velocidade de batalha x3<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Tempo máximo de recompensa offline: 24h<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>毎日大量のジェム<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>バトルごとのバフリロール +1<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>バトル速度x3<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>最大オフライン報酬：24時間<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>每天都有大量宝石<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>每场战斗+1次增益刷新<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>3x战斗速度<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>最长离线奖励时间：24小时<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>매일 보석 대량 지급<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>전투당 버프 새로고침 +1<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>전투 속도 3x<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>최대 방치 보상 시간: 24시간<br>"
      - 
      - 
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Багато самоцвітів щодня<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>+1 заміна підсилення на бій<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Швидкість бою 3x<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Макс. час нагород за відсутності: 24 год.<br>"
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: SUBSCRIPTION/Pack_Description_Midas
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Golden Oven—Unlimited Recycles<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Golden Hand—Unlimited Hand Usage<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Gems every day<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Золотая печка: безлимитное использование<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Золотая рука: безлимитное использование<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Самоцветы каждый день<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Goldener Ofen – Unbegrenzte Wiederverwertungen<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Goldene Hand – Unbegrenzte Handverwendungen<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Täglich Edelsteine<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Four doré – Recyclages illimités<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Main dorée – Utilisation illimitée de la main<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Gemmes tous les jours<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Horno dorado: reciclaje ilimitado<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Mano dorada: uso de mano ilimitado<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Gemas diarias<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Fornace d'oro - Ricicli illimitati<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Mano d'oro - Utilizzi illimitati della mano<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Gemme ogni giorno<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Forno Dourado: reciclagem ilimitada<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Mão Dourada: uso da mão ilimitado<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Joias todo dia<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>黄金のオーブン：リサイクル無限<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>黄金の手：手の使用無限<br> \n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>毎日ジェム<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>黄金烤箱——无限回收<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>黄金之手——无限使用手<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>每天获得宝石<br>"
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>황금 오븐 - 무제한 재활용<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>황금 손 - 무제한 손 사용<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>매일 보석 지급<br>"
      - 
      - 
      - "<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Золота піч — необмежене перероблення<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Золота рука — необмежена кількість використань руки<br>\n<sprite name=BulletPoint_Subscription>Самоцвіти щодня<br>"
      - 
