    - Term: BUFF/Buff_Description_330149
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '<size=50>Ice Gun</size>\nATK <color=#009421>+30%</Color> when you have exactly <color=#009421>2 guns</Color>'
      - '<size=50>Ледяная пушка</size>\nАтака <color=#009421>+30%</Color>, если у тебя ровно <color=#009421>2 пушки</Color>'
      - '<size=50>Eispistole</size>\nANG <color=#009421>+30 %</Color>, wenn du genau <color=#009421>2 Pistolen</Color> hast'
      - '<size=50>Pistolet de glace</size>\nATQ <color=#009421>+30 %</Color> quand tu possèdes exactement <color=#009421>2 pistolets</Color>'
      - '<size=50>Pistola de hielo</size>\nATQ <color=#009421>+30 %</Color> al llevar exactamente <color=#009421>2 armas</Color>'
      - '<size=50>Sparaghiaccio</size>\nATT: <color=#009421>+30%</Color> possedendo esattamente <color=#009421>2 sparaghiaccio</Color>'
      - '<size=50>Arma de Gelo</size>\nATQ <color=#009421>+30%</Color> ao possuir exatamente <color=#009421>2 armas</Color>'
      - '<size=50>アイスガン</size>\nATK <color=#009421>+30%</Color>（<color=#009421>二丁拳銃時</Color>のみ）'
      - '<size=50>冰枪</size>\n当你正好拥有<color=#009421>2把枪</Color>时，攻击力<color=#009421>+30%</Color>'
      - '<size=50>얼음 총</size>\n정확히 <color=#009421>2개의 총</Color>을 장착 시 공격 <color=#009421>+30%</Color>'
      - 
      - 
      - '<size=50>Кригомет</size>\nАтака <color=#009421>+30%</Color>, коли споряджено рівно <color=#009421>2 гармати</Color>'
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: BUFF/Buff_Description_330150
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - '<size=50>Ice Gun</size>\nBullets can <color=blue>Bounce</color> off walls\nBullet Size <color=#009421>+30%</Color>'
      - '<size=50>Ледяная пушка</size>\nПули могут <color=blue>рикошетить</color> от стен\nРазмер пули <color=#009421>+30%</Color>'
      - '<size=50>Eispistole</size>\nKugeln können von Wänden <color=blue>abprallen</color>\nKugelgröße <color=#009421>+30 %</Color>'
      - '<size=50>Pistolet de glace</size>\nLes balles peuvent <color=blue>rebondir</color> sur les murs\nTaille des balles <color=#009421>+30 %</Color>'
      - '<size=50>Pistola de hielo</size>\nLas balas pueden <color=blue>rebotar</color> en las paredes\nTamaño de las balas <color=#009421>+30 %</Color>'
      - '<size=50>Sparaghiaccio</size>\nI proiettili <color=blue>rimbalzano</color> sulle pareti\nDimensioni proiettili: <color=#009421>+30%</Color>'
      - '<size=50>Arma de Gelo</size>\nBalas podem <color=blue>ricochetear</color> nas paredes\nTamanho da bala <color=#009421>+30%</Color>'
      - '<size=50>アイスガン</size>\n弾丸が壁に<color=blue>バウンス</color>\n弾丸のサイズ <color=#009421>+30%</Color>'
      - '<size=50>冰枪</size>\n子弹可从墙壁上<color=blue>反弹</color>\n子弹体积<color=#009421>+30%</Color>'
      - '<size=50>얼음 총</size>\n탄환이 벽에 <color=blue>튕길</color> 수 있음\n탄환 크기 <color=#009421>+30%</Color>'
      - 
      - 
      - '<size=50>Кригомет</size>\nКулі можуть <color=blue>рикошетити</color> від стін\nРозмір кулі <color=#009421>+30%</Color>'
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
